  "name": "EU Security and Justice Sub-Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": 176,
  "purpose": "<p>The Sub-Committee examines the Government’s approach the UK’s future relationship with the EU in respect of internal and external security matters, including criminal justice, policing, data-sharing and defence.</p>\r\n<p>This Committee is a Sub-Committee of the <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/176/european-union-committee/\">European Union Select Committee</a></p>\r\n<p>Follow the European Union Committee on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LordsEUCom\">Twitter</a></p>",
